# Deploy y CI

## Target

- Firebase Hosting, project `miguel-angel-gutierrez-ibague`
- Public URL (default): `https://miguel-angel-gutierrez-ibague.web.app` (`environment.siteUrl`)
- Public dir: `dist/personal-presentation-miguel-gutierrez/browser`
- SPA rewrite a `index.html` (static files like `robots.txt` / `sitemap.xml` are served first)
- Headers: `X-Content-Type-Options`, `X-Frame-Options`, `Referrer-Policy`, `Permissions-Policy`; long-cache for hashed JS/CSS; `no-cache` for `index.html`

## GitHub Actions (CircleCI eliminado)

- `ci.yml` — push/PR → `npm ci` + `npm run build`
- `deploy.yml` — push `master` → build + live channel
- `firebase-hosting-pull-request.yml` — PR → preview channel

Secret requerido: `FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT` (JSON de service account).

## Validación

- Gate principal: `npm run build`
- **Pendiente (futuro):** crear/reescribir tests reales + `npm run lint`, y entonces añadir lint + tests a `ci.yml` (y workflows relacionados)
- Mientras tanto: no correr ni añadir `npm test` / lint / e2e en CI

## Manual

`npm run build` luego `npx firebase-tools deploy --only hosting`
